# Cloudflare Tunnel token for the Feature 068 Ledger Web UI (one tunnel per environment).
# Copy to docker/cloudflared.dev.env and docker/cloudflared.prod.env (both gitignored),
# one token each, then `./apps/webapp/run_webapp.sh dev|prod` brings the cloudflared-<env>
# container up alongside webapp-frontend-<env>.
#
# Create the tunnel in the Cloudflare Zero Trust dashboard (Networks -> Tunnels), route its
# public hostname (e.g. ledger-dev.<domain> / ledger.<domain>) to
# http://webapp-frontend-<env>:80, and paste the connector token below. The tunnel must be
# pointed ONLY at the webapp-frontend service - never denidin-app / morning-mcp-app.
TUNNEL_TOKEN=
